  B[Backend API\n- Demo token issuance\n- AuthZ and tenant isolation\n- Commands to events\n- Realtime token brokerage]:::backend
  R[Event Router and Consumers\n- Persistence consumer\n- Projection and search consumer\n- Audit emission\n- Preferences/templates/directory/context updates]:::eventing
